     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><div><br></div><div>I am trying to obtain the skewness and kurtosis of a time envelope. </div><div><br></div><div>Here is an example: <a href=\"http://www.plosone.org/article/info%3Adoi%2F10.1371%2Fjournal.pone.0102842\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.plosone.org/article/info%253Adoi%252F10.1371%252Fjournal.pone.0102842&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472373642000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0r6N6zyHsGWPVpcPkiBkEN\">http://www.plosone.org/article/info%3Adoi%2F10.1371%2Fjournal.pone.0102842</a></div><div><br></div><div><div>I have written a function, copying part of the &quot;specprop&quot; function, however the results are bizarre.</div><div><br></div><div>Any help would be highly useful</div></div><div><br></div><div>All the best!</div><div><br></div><div>Felipe</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Here is the code and some tests:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">seewave</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">envprop<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#c3892c\">function</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">(</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">) {</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>envAmp<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- </span>envel</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">envTime</span> &lt;- seq(<span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span>:length(<span style=\"color:#000000\">envAmp</span>))*(<span style=\"color:#000000\">smo</span>/<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>amp<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- </span>envAmp<span style=\"color:#042299\">/sum(</span>envAmp<span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">w</span> &lt;- sd(<span style=\"color:#000000\">amp</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">L</span> &lt;- length(<span style=\"color:#000000\">envAmp</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\">        <span style=\"color:#000000\">skew</span> &lt;- (sum((<span style=\"color:#000000\">amp</span> - mean(<span style=\"color:#000000\">amp</span>))^<span style=\"color:#055118\">3</span>)/(<span style=\"color:#000000\">L</span> - <span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span>))/<span style=\"color:#000000\">w</span>^<span style=\"color:#055118\">3</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\">        <span style=\"color:#000000\">kurt</span> &lt;- (sum((<span style=\"color:#000000\">amp</span> - mean(<span style=\"color:#000000\">amp</span>))^<span style=\"color:#055118\">4</span>)/(<span style=\"color:#000000\">L</span> - <span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span>))/<span style=\"color:#000000\">w</span>^<span style=\"color:#055118\">4</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>plot(</span>amp<span style=\"color:#042299\">~</span>envTime<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>type<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;l&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>legend(<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;bottom&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">legend</span>=c(paste(<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;Skew = &quot;</span>, round(<span style=\"color:#000000\">skew</span>,<span style=\"color:#055118\">6</span>), <span style=\"color:#000000\">sep</span>=<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;&quot;</span>), paste(<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;Kurt = &quot;</span>, round(<span style=\"color:#000000\">kurt</span>, <span style=\"color:#055118\">6</span>), <span style=\"color:#000000\">sep</span>=<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;&quot;</span>)))</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>results<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- list(</span>skew<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>skew<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>kurt<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>kurt<span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>return(<span style=\"color:#000000\">results</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\">}</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">30</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(5,81,24)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>44100</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">a</span> &lt;- synth(<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">d</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">cf</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">1000</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># test for positive skew</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">a1</span> &lt;- fadew(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">din</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">0.2</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">dout</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">0.8</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">osc</span> &lt;- oscillo(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a1</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">plot</span>=<span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">envel<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- env(</span>osc<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>msmooth<span style=\"color:#042299\">=c(</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">0</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">), </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span> plot<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span><span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\">envprop(</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># test for negative skew</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">a2</span> &lt;- fadew(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">din</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">0.8</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">dout</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">0.2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">osc</span> &lt;- oscillo(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a2</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> plot</span>=<span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">envel<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- env(</span>osc<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>msmooth<span style=\"color:#042299\">=c(</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">0</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">), </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span> plot<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span><span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\">envprop(</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\">#test for kurtosis of different windows </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">awh</span> &lt;- ftwindow(<span style=\"color:#055118\">44100</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">wn</span>=<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;hanning&quot;</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">a3<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- </span>a<span style=\"color:#042299\">*</span>awh</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">osc</span> &lt;- oscillo(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a3</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> plot</span>=<span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">envel<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- env(</span>osc<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>msmooth<span style=\"color:#042299\">=c(</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">0</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">), </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span> plot<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span><span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\">envprop(</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">awf</span> &lt;- ftwindow(<span style=\"color:#055118\">44100</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">wn</span>=<span style=\"color:#b0140c\">&quot;flattop&quot;</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">a4<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- </span>a<span style=\"color:#042299\">*</span>awf</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">osc</span> &lt;- oscillo(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a4</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> plot</span>=<span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">envel<span style=\"color:#042299\"> &lt;- env(</span>osc<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>msmooth<span style=\"color:#042299\">=c(</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">0</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">), </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">,</span> plot<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span><span style=\"color:#c3892c\">F</span><span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#042299\">envprop(</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>envel<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>smo<span style=\"color:#042299\">, </span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">=</span>f<span style=\"color:#042299\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,34,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
